Terms of use for the synthetic aizuchi data

The files in this directory (the "Data") were written by Claude (model
claude-fable-5-1, made by Anthropic) on 2026-09-20, following the instructions
in GEN_PROMPT.md and LABELS.md. The prompts, the label design and the selection
of the rows are by Sakasegawa. Generated text may not be protected by copyright
in your jurisdiction; to the extent any rights exist in the Data, Sakasegawa
makes them available to you under the following conditions.

1. You may use, copy, modify and redistribute the Data to train, fine-tune and
   evaluate classifiers and other models that do not generate open-ended text,
   for any purpose, including commercial use.

2. You may not use the Data, alone or as part of a larger collection, to train,
   fine-tune or distill:
   a. general-purpose chatbots or assistants,
   b. models whose purpose is open-ended text generation, or
   c. any model that competes with Anthropic's models or services.
   You may not use the Data as training targets for imitating the outputs of
   Claude.

3. If you redistribute the Data or a modified version of it, include this file,
   or terms that are no less restrictive than conditions 1 and 2, and state that
   the Data was generated by Claude.

THE DATA IS PROVIDED "AS IS", WITHOUT WARRANTY OF ANY KIND, EXPRESS OR IMPLIED,
INCLUDING BUT NOT LIMITED TO THE WARRANTIES OF ACCURACY, MERCHANTABILITY,
FITNESS FOR A PARTICULAR PURPOSE AND NONINFRINGEMENT. IN NO EVENT SHALL THE
AUTHORS BE LIABLE FOR ANY CLAIM, DAMAGES OR OTHER LIABILITY ARISING FROM, OUT OF
OR IN CONNECTION WITH THE DATA OR THE USE OF THE DATA.
